@host = http://localhost:5080
@orderId = paste-created-id-here

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-101",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "P-101",
      "productName": "Ноутбук",
      "price": 32999.99,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": "P-102",
      "productName": "Миша",
      "price": 849.50,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Copy id from Create response to orderId above, then read it
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### List
GET {{host}}/api/orders

### Update
PUT {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-101",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "P-103",
      "productName": "Монітор",
      "price": 10999.90,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Validation error (400)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "",
  "lines": []
}

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Read after Delete (404)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
